tes a Performance to the City where it takes place.\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Performance ;\\n    rdfs:range :City ;\\n    owl:inverseOf :cityPerformance .\\n\\n:cityPerformance a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"city performance\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Inverse: Relates a City to Performances held there.\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :City ;\\n    rdfs:range :Performance ;\\n    owl:inverseOf :performanceLocation .\\n\\n:cityInRegion a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"city in region\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates a City to the Region it is located in.\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :City ;\\n    rdfs:range :Region ;\\n    owl:inverseOf :regionHasCity .\\n\\n:regionHasCity a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"region has city\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Inverse: Relates a Region to the Cities it contains.\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Region ;\\n    rdfs:range :City ;\\n    owl:inverseOf :cityInRegion .\\n\\n:regionInCountry a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"region in country\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Relates a Region to the Country it is located in.\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Region ;\\n    rdfs:range :Country ;\\n    owl:inverseOf :countryHasRegion .\\n\\n:countryHasRegion a owl:ObjectProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"country has region\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Inverse: Relates a Country to the Regions it contains.\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Country ;\\n    rdfs:range :Region ;\\n    owl:inverseOf :regionInCountry .\\n\\n### Data Properties\\n\\n:membershipTime a owl:DatatypeProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"membership time\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The time period of a BandMembership (e.g., as a string or interval).\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :BandMembership ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string .\\n\\n:recordingStart a owl:DatatypeProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"recording start\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The start date of an AlbumRecording (as xsd:string for OWL2 compliance).\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :AlbumRecording ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string .\\n\\n:recordingEnd a owl:DatatypeProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"recording end\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The end date of an AlbumRecording (as xsd:string for OWL2 compliance).\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :AlbumRecording ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string .\\n\\n:trackCount a owl:DatatypeProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"track count\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The number of tracks on an album.\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Album ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .\\n\\n:releaseDate a owl:DatatypeProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"release date\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The release date of an album (as xsd:string for OWL2 compliance).\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Album ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string .\\n\\n:songComposedOn a owl:DatatypeProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"song composed on\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The date a song was composed (as xsd:string for OWL2 compliance).\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Song ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string .\\n\\n:reviewText a owl:DatatypeProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"review text\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The text of a critic's review.\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :CriticReview ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string .\\n\\n:performanceDate a owl:DatatypeProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\\n    rdfs:label \\\"performance date\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"The date of a performance (as xsd:string for OWL2 compliance).\\\" ;\\n    rdfs:domain :Performance ;\\n    rdfs:range xsd:string .\\n\\n### General Class Axioms and Restrictions\\n\\n:Album owl:equivalentClass [\\n    a owl:Restriction ;\\n    owl:onProperty :hasTrack ;\\n    owl:someValuesFrom :Track\\n] ;\\n    rdfs:comment \\\"Every album has at least one track.\\\" .\\n\\n### Disjointness\\n\\n:Person owl:disjointWith :Band .\\n:Instrument owl:disjointWith :Role .\\n:Album owl:disjointWith :Song .\\n:Performance owl:disjointWith :Critic .\\n:City owl:disjointWith :Country .\\